  m_text: "Keep those whiskers twitching, Two-Legs! The moment you grab an order,
    your UI will light up with the table number and their demands. It\u2019s like
    a treasure map, but the treasure is caffeine and the map is... well, on your
    screen. </color><color=#FF9E3A> With a cupcake and coffee in hand, interact with
    the table to serve them </color>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
